*   `BORN_IN`: Person -> Location (唯一的、最精确的出生地)
*   `ALUMNUS_OF`: Person -> Organization (正式学习经历，目标需具备学历性质)
*   `MEMBER_OF`: Person/Organization -> Organization (成员身份，包括担任具体职务)
*   `CHILD_OF`: Person -> Person (source是子女, target是父母)
