*   `FRIEND_OF`: Person/Organization - Person/Organization (交好)
*   `ENEMY_OF`: Person/Organization - Person/Organization (交恶)
*   `SUBORDINATE_OF`: Person/Organization -> Person/Organization (直接上下级隶属关系，包括师徒)
*   `MET_WITH`: Person - Person (最宽泛的人际关系，只要见过面)
*   `FOUNDED`: Person/Organization -> Organization (创立组织)
*   `PUSHED`: Person/Organization/Event/Movement/Document -> Person/Organization/Event/Movement/Document (起推动、促进作用)
*   `BLOCKED`: Person/Organization/Event/Movement/Document -> Person/Organization/Event/Movement/Document (起阻碍、反对作用)
*   `INFLUENCED`: Person/Organization/Event/Movement/Document -> Person/Organization/Event/Movement/Document/Location (通用关系，当其他具体关系不适用时使用，或涉及地点)

**需要删除的情况：**
1.  **方向错误**: 有向关系source/target位置弄反，需有明确依据。
